{"suttaId":"tha-ap123","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[5680,5708],"vripara":"1"},"segments":{"tha-ap123:0.3":"Sereyyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap123:1.1":"“Ajjhāyako mantadharo, tiṇṇaṃ vedāna pāragū;","tha-ap123:1.3":"Abbhokāse ṭhito santo, addasaṃ lokanāyakaṃ.","tha-ap123:2.1":"“Sīhaṃ yathā vanacaraṃ, byaggharājaṃva nittasaṃ;","tha-ap123:2.3":"Tidhāpabhinnamātaṅgaṃ, kuñjaraṃva mahesinaṃ.","tha-ap123:3.1":"“Sereyyakaṃ gahetvāna, ākāse ukkhipiṃ [nikkhipiṃ (ka.)] ahaṃ;","tha-ap123:3.3":"Buddhassa ānubhāvena, parivārenti sabbaso [sabbato (sī.)].","tha-ap123:4.1":"“Adhiṭṭhahi mahāvīro, sabbaññū lokanāyako;","tha-ap123:4.3":"Samantā pupphacchadanā, okiriṃsu narāsabhaṃ.","tha-ap123:5.1":"“Tato sā pupphakañcukā, antovaṇṭā bahimukhā;","tha-ap123:5.3":"Sattāhaṃ chadanaṃ katvā, tato antaradhāyatha.","tha-ap123:6.1":"“Tañca acchariyaṃ disvā, abbhutaṃ lomahaṃsanaṃ;","tha-ap123:6.3":"Buddhe cittaṃ pasādesiṃ, sugate lokanāyake.","tha-ap123:7.1":"“Tena cittappasādena, sukkamūlena codito;","tha-ap123:7.3":"Kappānaṃ satasahassaṃ, duggatiṃ nupapajjahaṃ.","tha-ap123:8.1":"“Pannarasasahassamhi, kappānaṃ pañcavīsati;","tha-ap123:8.3":"Vītamalā [cittamālā (sī.), vilāmālā (syā.)] samānā ca, cakkavattī mahabbalā.","tha-ap123:9.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;","tha-ap123:9.3":"Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap123:10.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā sereyyako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap123:11.1":"Sereyyakattherassāpadānaṃ paṭhamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2895,"to":2896,"paras":[{"para":2895,"vripara":"1","refs":["tha-ap123:1"],"lines":["So aparabhāge purākatakusalaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>ajjhāyako mantadharo</b>tiādimāha.","Taṃ heṭṭhā vuttatthameva."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap123:1"],["tha-ap123:1"]]},{"para":2896,"vripara":"3","refs":["tha-ap123:3"],"lines":["<b>Sereyyakaṃ gahetvānā</b>ti sirise bhavaṃ jātipupphaṃ sereyyaṃ, sereyyameva sereyyakaṃ, taṃ sereyyakaṃ gahetvānāti sambandho.","Bhagavati pasanno jātisumanamakuḷacampakādīni pupphāni patiṭṭhapetvā pūjetuṃ kālaṃ natthitāya tattha sampattaṃ taṃ sereyyakaṃ pupphaṃ gahetvā pūjesinti attho.","Sesaṃ sabbattha uttānamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap123:3"],["tha-ap123:3"],["tha-ap123:3"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap123:1.1","ajjhāyako mantadharo",0,0],["tha-ap123:3.1","sereyyakaṃ gahetvānā",1,0]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
